            </note>
            <note corresp="#d40-f2" n="2" xml:id="d40-f2-content">
                <p>Apparent reference to Nixon.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d40-f3" n="3" xml:id="d40-f3-content">
                <p>Apparent reference to Radio Free Europe.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d40-f4" n="4" xml:id="d40-f4-content">
                <p>It is unclear to which meeting Hillenbrand is referring.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d40-f5" n="5" xml:id="d40-f5-content">
                <p>See <ref target="#d35">Documents 35</ref> and <ref target="#d38">38</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
